    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86955" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδια-βάλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>raise prejudices against beforehand,</i>
